SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

The MIT grant above covers the Lean 4 source in `GDT/` and `GDT.lean`, the
paper source `paper.tex`, and `README.md`.

It does NOT cover the passages in `Y14.5.1-definitions.md` that are quoted from
ASME Y14.5.1-2019 and ASME Y14.5-2009. Those remain the copyright of the
American Society of Mechanical Engineers and are reproduced here for reference
and scholarly commentary. They are not licensed for redistribution by this
project. The standards themselves are available for purchase from ASME at
https://www.asme.org/codes-standards
